Jarrow rule tables: CC0 1.0 Universal

SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0

The files in this directory (rules/) and its subdirectories are the Jarrow
rule tables: data that describes how Fabric API shapes correspond to NeoForge
API shapes. To the extent possible under law, the Jarrow contributors have
waived all copyright and related or neighboring rights to the rule tables,
dedicating them to the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0
Universal Public Domain Dedication.

The full legal code is published by Creative Commons at:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

This dedication covers the rule tables only. The rest of the Jarrow
repository is licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE at the repository
root). Names of third-party APIs that appear in the tables (for example class
and method names from Fabric API or NeoForge) belong to their projects and are
used only to identify them; see rules/SOURCES.md.
